    "detailed_description": "Puzzle Box is a collection of ten educational and fun puzzle games that will challenge your mind and keep you entertained for hours on end. With a variety of puzzles to choose from, there is something for everyone in Puzzle Box.<br />\r\nPuzzle Box is also a great game for people of all ages. It's a fun and challenging way to improve your problem-solving skills and have some fun at the same time<br />\r\nPuzzle Box currently has<br />\r\n1. Find Objects -- Search and Find the Hidden Items<br />\r\n2. Word Search -- Search and Find the Hidden Words<br />\r\n3. Rememberry -- Test Your Memory<br />\r\n4. Photo Puzzles HD -- A Good Old Puzzle Game<br />\r\n5. Geo. Quiz -- Test Your Geography Knowledge<br />\r\n6. Spot It -- Find Ten Hidden Differences<br />\r\n7. Word Ninja (Anagram) -- Let's Make Words<br />\r\n8. Zombie Attack (Hangman) -- Guess the Word<br />\r\n9. Find Numbers -- Search and Find the Hidden Numbers<br />\r\n10. Match Pairs -- A Fun and Relaxing Puzzle Game<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n\u25cf Ten games in 1. No downloadable contents (DLCs) required, all games in this collection are fully unlocked!<br />\r\n\u25cf Various game modes, tons of difficulty levels<br />\r\n\u25cf Thousands of levels from easy to difficult are waiting for you<br />\r\n\u25cf Travel the World, Enjoy Virtual Vacation and Discover the Animal Kingdom<br />\r\n\u25cf Fun and classic gameplay<br />\r\n\u25cf Suitable for both kids and adults<br />\r\n\u25cf Hundreds of beautiful HD photos<br />\r\n\u25cf Calming music, peaceful atmospheres<br />\r\n\u25cf Stunning graphics, cute characters<br />\r\n\u25cf Fun sound effects, modern design<br />\r\n\u25cf Easy and relaxing to play, hard to master",
    "about_the_game": "Puzzle Box is a collection of ten educational and fun puzzle games that will challenge your mind and keep you entertained for hours on end. With a variety of puzzles to choose from, there is something for everyone in Puzzle Box.<br />\r\nPuzzle Box is also a great game for people of all ages. It's a fun and challenging way to improve your problem-solving skills and have some fun at the same time<br />\r\nPuzzle Box currently has<br />\r\n1. Find Objects -- Search and Find the Hidden Items<br />\r\n2. Word Search -- Search and Find the Hidden Words<br />\r\n3. Rememberry -- Test Your Memory<br />\r\n4. Photo Puzzles HD -- A Good Old Puzzle Game<br />\r\n5. Geo. Quiz -- Test Your Geography Knowledge<br />\r\n6. Spot It -- Find Ten Hidden Differences<br />\r\n7. Word Ninja (Anagram) -- Let's Make Words<br />\r\n8. Zombie Attack (Hangman) -- Guess the Word<br />\r\n9. Find Numbers -- Search and Find the Hidden Numbers<br />\r\n10. Match Pairs -- A Fun and Relaxing Puzzle Game<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n\u25cf Ten games in 1. No downloadable contents (DLCs) required, all games in this collection are fully unlocked!<br />\r\n\u25cf Various game modes, tons of difficulty levels<br />\r\n\u25cf Thousands of levels from easy to difficult are waiting for you<br />\r\n\u25cf Travel the World, Enjoy Virtual Vacation and Discover the Animal Kingdom<br />\r\n\u25cf Fun and classic gameplay<br />\r\n\u25cf Suitable for both kids and adults<br />\r\n\u25cf Hundreds of beautiful HD photos<br />\r\n\u25cf Calming music, peaceful atmospheres<br />\r\n\u25cf Stunning graphics, cute characters<br />\r\n\u25cf Fun sound effects, modern design<br />\r\n\u25cf Easy and relaxing to play, hard to master",
